  "description": "<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">PinkBear is a premium wellness brand dedicated to empowering women through high-quality supplements. Our mission is to support women in achieving optimal health while making a positive impact on the world. For every purchase, we donate a percentage of our sales to women&rsquo;s charities, ensuring that your partnership contributes to a greater cause.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Product Description:</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our supplements are crafted with care, using only the finest ingredients to cater to women&rsquo;s unique health needs. Whether it&rsquo;s boosting energy, enhancing beauty, or supporting overall well-being, our product range is designed to meet diverse lifestyles and health goals. Every product reflects our commitment to quality, safety, and efficacy.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h3>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<li><strong>Empowerment Through Wellness:</strong> We cater exclusively to women, ensuring personalized health solutions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Charity with Every Purchase:</strong> A percentage of every sale supports women&rsquo;s charities, combining health with impact.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Premium Quality:</strong> All our supplements are meticulously formulated for effectiveness and are tested for purity.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Inclusive Community:</strong> Affiliates join a like-minded network of advocates championing women&rsquo;s health and wellness.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Payment Terms:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<li><strong>Commission Rate:</strong> Competitive commission for every successful referral purchase. Rates will start at 15%</li>\r\n<li><strong>Payment Frequency:</strong> Monthly payments through your preferred method.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Tracking &amp; Transparency:</strong> Affiliates receive unique tracking links and detailed reports to monitor sales and earnings.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Other Information:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<li><strong>Affiliate Support:</strong> We provide high-quality marketing materials, including banners, product images, and copy to help affiliates succeed.</li>\r\n<li><strong>No Hidden Costs:</strong> Joining the program is free with no upfront fees.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Long Cookie Duration:</strong> Affiliates benefit from a 30day cookie policy to ensure fair credit for sales.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Exclusive Offers:</strong> Affiliates will have access to exclusive discounts and promotions to share with their audience.</li>\r\n</ul>",
